irm gritty tissue in H  The remainder of the breast parenchyma is appropriate for age  with fibrocystic changes  cysts up to 0 8cm in diameter   representative sections in I through K  Multiple unremarkable lymph nodes of up to 1 0cm are identified in the axillary fat  submitted in L through P  Resident  MARYAM S  MOHAMMADKHANI  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   MASTECTOMY   report_end  , No.
