eptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  21 AUG 97 at 08 45 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in frozen section lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  s name  unit number and  right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm fragment of yellow tan tissue  which is cut and sectioned to reveal a firm  gritty  tan white mass that is 0 6cm in greatest dimension with an ill defined border  No frozen section was done  The specimen has been submitted in its entirety in A B  Resident  DANIELLE ELLIOTT  M D      INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  RIGHT BREAST   LESION SUSPICIOUS FOR INVASIVE CARCINOMA  TOO SMALL TO FREEZE  AWAIT PERMANENT SECTIONS  O R  Resident  RHONDA YANTISS  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Suzanne B  Keel  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART   BREAST RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , No.
