ned that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  09 AUG 01 at 13 08     ADDITIONAL DIAGNOSTIC INFORMATION Addendum     The positive sentinel lymph node is 1 0cm in greatest dimension with a metastatic tumor focus measuring 0 1cm x 0 1cm  There is no evidence of extranodal spread  Added by  SELIM NASSER  MD Signed On  20 AUG 01 at 17 06 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  breast tumor  short stitch superior  long stitch lateral  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 6 0cm section of fibrofatty tissue  The anterior surface is inked black and the posterior surface is inked blue  On sectioning there is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm firm  white  irregular gritty mass measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  The mass is 3 2cm from the superior margin  REMOVED_DATE from the inferior margin  0 6cm from the lateral margin  0 3cm from the medial margin  0 5cm from the anterior margin and 0 5cm from the posterior margin  There also is an area of apparent fat necrosis in the superior portion of the specimen  This area measures REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm  The area of fat necrosis is 0 5cm from the lateral resection margin  Sections from the specimen are submitted in cassettes A J  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  sentinel node hot and blue level 1 939  is a fragment of adipose tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm  The tissue contains 2 apparent lymph nodes each measuring 1 0cm in greatest dimension  The lymph nodes are bisected and submitted in cassettes K L  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final shave margin medial half of cavity  is one piece of adipose tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  The specimen is unoriented  Representative sections of the specimen ar