hemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  08 AUG 97 at 14 15 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the frozen section lab labeled  left breast mass  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm fatty breast tissue  The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal white streaks and one very tiny nodule  0 5cm in diameter  The remainder of the parenchyma is grossly unremarkable  The specimen is too small for frozen  no frozen done  The nodule is submitted in A  The remainder submitted in B and C  Resident  Dennis Sgroi  M D      INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DX ONLY  BREAST LEFT  BIOPSY   A SMALL REMOVED_DATE CM FIRM NODULE TOO SMALL FOR FROZEN SECTION AND ER PURPOSES  ALL SUBMITTED FOR PERMANENTS  O R  Resident  DAVID WEISSMANN  M D  O R  Diagnosis by  Austin L  Vickery  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Britain Walton Nicholson  M D  PART   LEFT BREAST MASS BIOPSY   report_end  , No.
